    {
      "number": 36,
      "name": "明夷",
      "symbol": "䷣",
      "upper": "坤",
      "lower": "離",
      "source_name": "明夷",
      "guaci": {
        "classical_text": "利艱貞。",
        "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-2a"
      },
      "tuan": {
        "classical_text": "明入地中，《明夷》。內文明而外柔順，以蒙大難，文王以之。「利艱貞」、晦其明也，內難而能正其志，箕子以之。",
        "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-3a"
      },
      "xiang": {
        "classical_text": "明入地中，《明夷》。君子以莅眾用晦而明。",
        "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-4a",
        "note": null
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "marker": "初九",
          "classical_text": "明夷于飛，垂其翼。君子于行，三日不食。有攸往，主人有言。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-5a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「君子于行」、義「不食」也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-6a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 1
        },
        {
          "marker": "六二",
          "classical_text": "明夷、夷于左股，用拯馬、壯吉。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-7a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「六二」之「吉」、順以則也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-8a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 2
        },
        {
          "marker": "九三",
          "classical_text": "明夷于南狩，得其大首，不可疾貞。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-9a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「南狩」之志、乃大得也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-10a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 3
        },
        {
          "marker": "六四",
          "classical_text": "入于左腹，獲明夷之心于出門庭。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-11a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「入于左腹」、獲心意也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-12a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 4
        },
        {
          "marker": "六五",
          "classical_text": "箕子之明夷，利貞。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_036-13a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
